   $q$How is the story's timeline organized?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It begins in 1871 and moves forward year by year until the map reaches the archive.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"},{"text":"It begins at the end of Dr. Mahoe's trip and then explains how she found the map.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"},{"text":"It begins in the present, shifts back to 1871, and returns to the present at the end.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It stays entirely in the present and describes the past only through the attic note.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It begins in the present, shifts back to 1871, and returns to the present at the end.$q$, $q$The story opens with the map arriving at the archive, then flashes back to Eliza's survey, then returns to Dr. Mahoe. The trip is only being planned at the end, not completed.$q$, 'draft', 'a240e601-b238-5151-b51a-ef6370d26827')
